      "id": "claim_de010bcedc60414bac0c920b13c8e75c",
      "statement": "hcp-terraform/rosa-boundary/main.tf also defines a separate rosa-boundary-prod AWS account (distinct AWS account ID 514903006123, confirmed by hcp-terraform/aws-creds/rosa-boundary-prod/main.tf's allowed_account_ids), which has grown from its initial credentials/account pair to six registered workspaces: credentials, account, and us-east-1/us-west-2 network/regional pairs reusing the same deploy/network and deploy/regional source roots as staging. All six prod workspaces set execution_mode = \"remote\", but only rosa-boundary-prod-aws-creds still sets auto_apply = false and auto_apply_run_trigger = false as a manual-apply gate; the other five prod workspaces (account, network-us-east-1, regional-us-east-1, network-us-west-2, regional-us-west-2) set auto_apply = true and auto_apply_run_trigger = true, mirroring staging's auto-apply workspaces. hcp-terraform/aws-creds/rosa-boundary-prod/main.tf's workspace_names allowlist now authorizes all six prod workspaces.",
